Hi Avra.  Yes, you can do all of the above at the same time.  If your  
network is called "mynet", then you'd type

summary( mynet ~ triangle + istar(0:3) + ostar(0:3) + m2star + mutual)

and of course you can throw in any other terms you like.

Dave




