I did have an error at Step 9 and Steve sent the following, which worked
immediately:

OK, try this:

Right click on My Computer and select Properties. Go to Advanced >
Environment Variables.  Select the system variable named "Path" and choose
Edit.  Now, you want to add your R path at the beginning of this.  For me
it is:

c:\Program Files\R\R-2.6.1\bin;

but it may differ for you, espeically if you have a different version of R
downloaded.

thanks everyone! happy network modeling.
