From buttsc at uci.edu  Thu Sep 11 00:29:07 2008
From: buttsc at uci.edu (Carter T. Butts)
Date: Thu Jun  7 11:20:29 2018
Subject: [statnet_help] plot.network() with colored edges
In-Reply-To: <48C8BD2D.4050306@stanford.edu>
References: <48C8BD2D.4050306@stanford.edu>
